Range Test Results#!#4#!#<NULL>#!#<NULL>#!#NULL values
Range Test Results#!#6#!#0.0001#!#0.0001#!#Small positive values
Range Test Results#!#7#!#-0.0001#!#-0.0001#!#Small negative values
Range Test Results#!#8#!#0.0000#!#0.0000#!#Zero Values
